LPL tex description

specification description 
   part Btypes	of sort list[identifier]
		modules sigSyntax
   part Mvars	of sort list[vardef]
		modules sigSyntax ivars[Btypes]
   part Bvars	of sort list[vardef]
		modules sigSyntax ivars[Btypes]
end  
query		of sort  texinput
		result of sort texoutput
		modules 
			texterms[Mvars,Btypes,Bvars] texhounif[Mvars,Btypes,Bvars]
			hounif[Mvars,Btypes,Bvars]
		start with (Protheo)totex(query)
end of LPL description




